:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">教皇利奥宣布将接受一次肺部手术，以切除一个小型增生物。这一消息引发了对其健康的关注，梵蒂冈已证实其状况稳定，并呼吁信众为他祈祷。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-10-12/victoria-fitzroy-north-suspicious-fire-arson-tobacco/107254786\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">墨尔本一烟草店爆炸起火，邻居描述现场情况</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Neighbours describe explosions as Melbourne tobacco shop burns down</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚墨尔本一家烟草店发生爆炸并引发火灾，店铺被彻底烧毁。附近居民描述了爆炸时的巨大声响和火光，调查人员正在对起火原因进行调查，怀疑可能涉及纵火或有组织犯罪。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲ABC新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/dissanayake-highlights-good-relations-with-india-points-to-new-delhis-katchatheevu-stance/article71572026.ece\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">迪萨纳亚克强调与印度“良好关系”，并提及新德里在卡恰提武岛问题上的立场</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Dissanayake highlights ‘good relations’ with India, points to New Delhi’s Katchatheevu stance</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">斯里兰卡人民解放阵线领导人阿努拉·库马拉·迪萨纳亚克在公开场合强调了斯里兰卡与印度的良好双边关系，并提及新德里在卡恰提武岛（Katchatheevu）主权问题上的立场，这反映出斯印两国在地区合作和领土议题上的微妙平衡。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">印度教徒报</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsinfo.inquirer.net/2321714/panelo-dark-horse-could-replace-sara-duterte-in-2028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">帕内洛：2028年大选“黑马”或取代萨拉·杜特尔特参选</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Panelo: ‘Dark horse’ could replace Sara Duterte in 2028</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">菲律宾前总统杜特尔特的首席法律顾问萨尔瓦多·帕内洛表示，2028年总统大选可能会出现一位“黑马”候选人，从而取代现任副总统萨拉·杜特尔特的参选前景。此言论引发了外界对未来政治格局变动的猜测。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">菲律宾每日问询者</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/oct/12/labor-anthony-albanese-greens-digital-duty-of-care-coalition-angus-taylor-one-nation-ntwnfb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">澳大利亚政坛动态：瑞安“不介意”弗莱登伯格可能回归；兰比指责工党在信息自由法案上“搞财政胁迫”</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Politics live: Ryan ‘not bothered’ by possible Frydenberg return; Lambie accuses Labor of ‘financial coercion’ over FOI</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">澳大利亚工党领袖瑞安表示不介意前财政部长弗莱登伯格重返政坛，而独立参议员兰比则公开指责执政的工党利用财政手段胁迫其在信息自由法案（FOI）改革上妥协，这反映了澳大利亚政坛内部的持续博弈和权力斗争。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">澳洲卫报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/nz-news/361045284/rnzaf-hercules-flies-fire-truck-and-crew-niue-after-wildfire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰皇家空军“大力神”运输机向纽埃运送消防车及人员，应对野火</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">RNZAF Hercules flies fire truck and crew to Niue after wildfire</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">新西兰皇家空军派出一架C-130“大力神”运输机，紧急向太平洋岛国纽埃运送消防车和消防队员，以协助扑灭当地的野火。此次行动凸显了新西兰对区域伙伴的人道主义援助承诺，以及应对自然灾害的快速响应能力。（官方视角）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/12/anti-taxxers-set-their-sights-on-wealth-taxes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">反税运动者将目光投向财富税</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Anti-taxxers set their sights on wealth taxes</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">全球反税运动者正将其抗议和游说焦点转向财富税，反对政府对富人征收更高税率以解决贫富差距和社会不公的提议。这一动向预示着未来围绕财富分配和税收公平的政策辩论将日益激烈，可能对多国财政和社会政策产生影响。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/pacific/1857504/imminent-threat-of-drought-in-niue-yellow-alert-declared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">纽埃面临“迫在眉睫的干旱威胁”，已发布黄色预警</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">&#x27;Imminent threat&#x27; of drought in Niue, yellow alert declared</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">太平洋岛国纽埃因长期缺乏降雨，面临“迫在眉睫的干旱威胁”，当局已发布黄色预警。这一情况对当地居民的饮用水供应、农业生产和生态环境构成严峻挑战，凸显了气候变化对小岛屿国家生存发展的深远影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqy43vrk8wv8o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">人权组织称埃及-苏丹边境冲突导致数十名淘金者死亡</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Dozens of gold prospectors killed in strikes on Egypt-Sudan border, rights group says</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">据一家人权组织报告，埃及与苏丹边境地区发生的冲突中，有数十名非法淘金者丧生。这起事件揭示了该地区非法采矿活动的危险性、边境控制的脆弱性，以及冲突对平民生命造成的严重威胁，引发对人道主义状况的关注。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr93znyk44e1o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">沙特首都机场两天内第二次遭到胡塞武装袭击</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Saudi capital airport hit by second Houthi strike in two days</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">沙特阿拉伯首都利雅得的国际机场在两天内第二次遭到也门胡塞武装的袭击。这表明也门冲突持续升级，胡塞武装有能力打击沙特腹地目标，对地区安全局势构成严峻挑战，并可能导致冲突进一步扩大。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj5ynwnye009o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">三名男子因在墨西哥谋杀两名澳大利亚冲浪兄弟和一名美国朋友被判有罪</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Three men found guilty of murdering two Australian surfer brothers and US friend in Mexico</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">墨西哥法院裁定三名男子犯有谋杀罪，他们去年在巴哈加利福尼亚州杀害了两名澳大利亚冲浪者和一名美国朋友。此案引发了国际关注，凸显了墨西哥部分地区对游客的安全挑战。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/11/waves-crash-into-homes-as-excavators-try-to-protect-california-properties?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">加州：海浪冲击房屋，挖掘机奋力保护海岸物业</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Waves crash into homes as excavators try to protect California properties</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在美国加利福尼亚州，巨浪持续侵袭沿海社区，对多处房屋造成严重威胁，工程人员正紧急操作挖掘机筑坝，以保护受影响的海岸物业。此次事件凸显了气候变化下，沿海地区面临的侵蚀与海平面上升的严峻挑战。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
